(v)
the documents, plates and marks to be carried by transportvehicles, the manner
in which they are to be carried and the languages in which any such
documents are to be expressed;
(vi)
the badges and uniform to be worn by drivers and conductors of stage
carriages and contract carriages;
(vii)
the fees to be paid in respect of permits, duplicate permits, plates and badges;
(viii)
the exemption of prescribed persons or classes of persons from payment of all
